<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, backgroundColor: '#FBFAF7', padding: '60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 15, color: '#0D7D6A', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.5, marginBottom: 10 }}>
        01 · 看题
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'SimSun', fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
        报名那天最容易高估自己
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E0DDD5', marginTop: 16, marginBottom: 26 }} />

    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', flex: 1 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 380, backgroundColor: '#0D7D6A', borderRadius: 8, paddingTop: 30, paddingBottom: 28, paddingLeft: 28, paddingRight: 28, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 15, color: '#9ED8C9', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 18 }}>
                    出发前，我们盘过一次自己
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'SimSun', fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.3, marginBottom: 6 }}>
                    六个人
                    <br />
                    全是大一
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 10 }}>
                {['没有体育教学资质', '没有医疗资质', '没有经费、没人带过队'].map((t, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 1, backgroundColor: '#6FB7A6', marginRight: 10 }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 17, color: '#D9EDE8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                            {t}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>

            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 16, color: '#9ED8C9', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 18 }}>
                盘的结果不太好看，但只有盘完，后面所有动作才站得住。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 44 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.4, marginBottom: 10 }}>
                盘完只剩两条路
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 18, color: '#4B5563', lineHeight: 1.62, marginBottom: 22 }}>
                一条是硬着头皮按原计划做，把自己当成「来教体育的」——这条路的尽头，是干不了还硬干。另一条是承认能力边界，重新想我们到底能补哪一块。我们选了第二条。
            </Text>

            <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                {[
                    { k: '承认没有教学资质', v: '不设计训练课，转而去设计游戏' },
                    { k: '承认没有医疗资质', v: '不给家长下判断，只报区间、建议就医' },
                    { k: '承认没有经费', v: '不铺大摊子，六个人 AA' }
                ].map((it, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #ECE9E2', paddingBottom: 12 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937', width: 190 }}>
                            {it.k}
                        </Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 18, color: '#6B7280', flex: 1 }}>
                            {it.v}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, borderLeft: '3px solid #C2410C', paddingLeft: 16 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'SimSun', fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F2937', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    一个团队到一个地方，要清楚自己是来干什么的。
                    <span style={{ color: '#6B7280', fontWeight: 'normal' }}>反过来也成立：若不清楚，最好先别来。</span>
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
